    "description_html": "<div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div tabindex=\"-1\" data-testid=\"loading-message\">\n<div>\n<div aria-live=\"assertive\">\n<div>\n<p>Elevate your brand with our Printed Wooden Name Badges, designed to combine sustainability and elegance. Perfect for businesses, events, and organizations looking to make a lasting impression, these name badges offer a unique and professional look.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits of Printed Wooden Name Badges</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Real Wood Construction</strong>: Crafted from real wood, our name badges are available in three popular sizes, providing a natural and authentic appearance.</li>\n<li><strong>Contrasting Dark Brown 'Burned' Edges</strong>: The dark brown edges add a touch of sophistication and contrast, enhancing the overall design.</li>\n<li><strong>Eco-Friendly and Recyclable</strong>: Made from sustainable materials, these badges are eco-friendly and recyclable, making them an excellent choice for environmentally conscious customers.</li>\n<li><strong>Full Color Printing</strong>: Enjoy vibrant, full-color printing of logos and text, ensuring your brand stands out.</li>\n<li><strong>Wide Range of Font Options</strong>: Customize your badges with a variety of font options to match your brand's style.</li>\n<li><strong>Pin or Magnetic Fittings</strong>: Choose between pin or magnetic fittings for easy attachment and versatility.</li>\n<li><strong>Rapid Production Times</strong>: Benefit from quick turnaround times, ensuring you receive your badges promptly.</li>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees &amp; No Design Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup or design costs.</li>\n<li><strong>Quantity-Based Prices</strong>: Enjoy competitive pricing with discounts based on order quantity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Please Note</strong>: As the name badges are made using real wood, there will be variations in color and grain between each badge, adding to th